/destiny2_content/icons/9650a58cd3a439bf3b53a53dbc8122a0.png","desc":"Causing damage with this weapon reduces recoil and flinch over time."},{"name":"Outlaw","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/382df469a091c33e190ee583b64923e8.png","desc":"Precision kills greatly decrease reload time."},{"name":"Firmly Planted","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/379796d2e74676d3790f0bd485ea03a9.png","desc":"Increased accuracy, stability, and handling when firing while crouched."}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Multikill Clip","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/3749921a74a378259228d5e989459311.png","desc":"Reloading grants increased damage based on the number of rapid final blows made beforehand."},{"name":"Thresh","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7f9dcf3bd4a8a4e0d2d0922827f038c9.png","desc":"Killing combatants with this weapon generates a small amount of Super energy."},{"name":"Tap the Trigger","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a7840da2970b4137a333fb187477dfe0.png","desc":"Grants a short period of increased stability and accuracy on initial trigger pull."},{"name":"Rampage","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8976ead57430e4f5f8af1b3005de4f83.png","desc":"Kills with this weapon temporarily grant increased damage. Stacks 3x."},{"name":"Frenzy","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/23e06f4ced1b3e6476f342978ff5bb37.png","desc":"Being in combat for an extended time increases damage, handling, and reload for this weapon until you are out of combat."},{"name":"One for All","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b1bce269c3cd21393131b4f5cffae692.png","desc":"Hitting three separate targets increases damage for a moderate duration."}]}],"notes":["[YeezyGT's S15] (PvE / PvP): [MW: Stability / Reload / Range] \"A personal favourite. For PvE, invest in; [Stability / Reload / Subsistence/Overflow / Rampage/Frenzy]. For PvP, invest in; [Surplus / Multikill Clip]. After IKELOS_SMG, this is likely the best 750RPM - and it definitely sounds like it. Subsistence is insanely strong on SMGs post-Primary changes, and Frenzy gives the perfect reload buff that SMGs direly need in PvE. In PvP, this is a strong contender, and up there as one of the best Legendary options, after Multimach in the same slot.\"","Inspired by Destiny Massive Breakdowns from Podcast 201. PvE/PvP firect choice roll. Recommended MW: Stability.","Inspired by Destiny Massive Breakdowns from Podcast 201. PvE/PvP first choice roll. Recommended MW: Stability.","Inspired by Destiny Massive Breakdowns from Podcast 201. PvE/PvP backup roll. Recommended MW: Stability.","File auto generated from csv pandapaxxy-s15-roundup (tags: controller,god-pve)","File auto generated from csv pandapaxxy-s15-roundup (tags: controller,god-pvp)","File auto generated from csv pandapaxxy-s15-roundup (tags: god-pvp)","File auto generated from csv pandapaxxy-s15-roundup (tags: controller,pve)","File auto generated from csv pandapaxxy-s15-roundup (tags: controller,pvp)","File auto generated from csv pandapaxxy-s15-roundup (tags: pvp)","Chevy's S14 Super Pog PvE Loot List (MKB/PVE). Recommended MW - Handling/Reload"],"estimated":null,"modes":{"all":{"rolls":[[4,11,29,32],[4,13,25,30],[7,13,25,33],[7,13,25,34],[7,13,26,30],[8,13,24,33],[8,13,24,34],[8,13,25,33],[8,13,25,34],[8,13,26,30],[2,13,24,33],[2,13,24,34],[2,13,25,30],[2,13,25,33],[2,13,25,34],[2,13,26,30],[4,13,26,30],[7,13,24,33],[7,13,24,34],[7,13,25,31],[7,17,24,33],[7,17,24,34],[7,17,25,33],[7,17,25,34],[7,17,26,30],[8,13,25,30],[8,17,24,33],[8,17,24,34],[8,17,25,33],[8,17,25,34],[8,17,26,30],[2,11,25,30],[2,11,26,30],[2,12,24,30],[2,12,24,33],[2,12,24,34],[2,12,25,30],[2,12,25,33],[2,12,25,34],[2,13,24,30],[2,17,24,33],[2,17,24,34],[2,17,25,33],[2,17,25,34],[2,17,26,30],[4,11,25,30],[4,11,25,32],[4,11,26,30],[4,11,26,32],[4,11,29,30],[4,12,25,30],[4,12,25,33],[4,12,25,34],[4,12,25,35],[4,12,28,30],[4,12,28,33],[4,12,28,34],[4,12,28,35],[4,13,24,34],[4,13,25,32],[4,13,25,33],[4,13,25,34],[4,13,25,35],[4,13,26,32],[4,13,28,